        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ricky Martin, Hank Osasuna\n- Works: Lemon La Vida Loca, Livin' la Vida Loca, Frío, Música + Alma + Sexo\n- Organizations: ITV2\n\nFacts:\n- Ricky Martin's song \"Livin' la Vida Loca\" was a number-one hit in 1999.\n- The show \"Lemon La Vida Loca\" derives its title from Ricky Martin's 1999 hit single \"Livin' la Vida Loca.\"\n- Ricky Martin's song \"Frío\" was the third single from his 2011 studio album \"Música + Alma + Sexo.\"\n- Hank Osasuna later appeared as Mad Paul in ITV2's series \"Lemon La Vida Loca.\"",
